WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:08.145
Morning. What needs me today?

2
00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:19.310
Two meetings, one deadline. I moved the
routine updates aside. There's one thing worth
your attention.

3
00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:23.822
Maya's birthday is Friday.

4
00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:31.601
I found a gift that fits what she likes. Shall
I order it?

5
00:00:31.821 --> 00:00:34.557
Show me the choice tonight. Don't buy it yet.

6
00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.370
Coffee on my way?

7
00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:48.972
Your usual, at the cafe ahead. Want me to
place it?

8
00:00:49.192 --> 00:00:49.682
Yes.

9
00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:54.195
Order confirmed.

10
00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:00.676
Lunch?

11
00:01:00.896 --> 00:01:03.756
You have twenty minutes. Want your usual
pickup?

12
00:01:03.976 --> 00:01:04.640
Go ahead.

13
00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:17.238
Your three o'clock moved. Travel time is now
tight.

14
00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:25.091
I can ask to move it online, or reschedule.

15
00:01:25.311 --> 00:01:27.512
Ask for online. Keep the time.

16
00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:33.816
One decision needs you. The team has two
viable directions.

17
00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:38.414
Give me the trade-off.

18
00:01:38.634 --> 00:01:43.490
One is faster. The other is easier to
maintain. I can't choose what matters more.

19
00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.723
Take the maintainable one. Tell them why.

20
00:01:50.943 --> 00:01:53.645
Understood. I'll draft the message for your
review.

21
00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:05.286
Maya's gift is ready for your decision.

22
00:02:05.506 --> 00:02:07.272
That one. You can order it.

23
00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:12.987
Nothing else needs your attention.
